<font size=3 color=#606060><strong>▽</strong> 2003/02/21 (金) 10:58:21 <strong>▽</strong> starbow </font></td>
<td nowrap align=right><font size=3>　<a href="bbs@res_200302215105821_log_starbow.cgi">返信</a>　削除<input type=checkbox name="target" value="200302215105821"></font>
